            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5,
            "previous_text": "Yes, \"yīfu\" (clothes) is right. That's the standard pronunciation in Mandarin.",
            "next_text": "When we write from memory in class, we get marked wrong if we write \"yīfú\" (clothes). Our teacher reminds us that the second syllable is in the neutral tone."
          },
          "sequence": "010",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:011",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "When we do dictation, it's wrong to write \"yīfú\" (clothes). Our teacher reminds us that the second syllable has a neutral tone.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-09-how-do-you-pronounce-yifu_dialogue_011_en-us.mp3",
